      "content": "i mean i guess so, but my doctor isnt even the type of person to give me a super strict lecture on this kind of stuff. honestly i just feel like i need it to actually drift off tonight. if i just stick to a very small amount, like a few sips, is there really a medical reason why that's a \"significant\" risk? it feels like you're being a bit cautious. i just want to know if it's actually dangerous or if you're just being extra safe.",
